ics.json","failure_cases.json",".enoch/project_decision.json"]'::jsonb, '["baseline comparison","metrics table","failure cases","decision artifact"]'::jsonb, '["False cache hits over-prune proposals","Little repetition in public traces","Cache lookup overhead dominates"]'::jsonb, 'small', 'small', 'gb10', 'gpt-5.5', 'danger-full-access', 8.00, 7.00, 8.00, 8.00, 70.30, '{"accessibility_weighted":20.0,"admit_threshold":72.0,"falsifiability_weighted":17.6,"feasibility_weighted":11.9,"hard_failure_penalty":0.0,"mode_bonus":0.0,"novelty_weighted":20.8,"review_threshold":58.0}'::jsonb, 'research:spec-decoding-negative-rejection-cache-agentic-speculation-record-rejected-speculative-continuations-penalize-or-avoid:4654868bcb7f', '[]'::jsonb, 'Adds negative memory to speculative draft selection rather than positive retrieval only.', 'Must keep the target verification lossless and prove cache only affects proposals.', '', 'chatgpt_pro_manual_import', 'ChatGPT Pro', 'manual_spec_decoding_research_map_2026-05-19', 'new-chatgpt-pro-ideas-05-19.md manual ingest', '{"candidate_seed":{"baseline_to_beat":"DFlash, suffix cache without negative memory, and autoregressive target decoding.","hypothesis":"Caching recently rejected continuations by context hash can avoid repeated bad draft proposals in looping agentic workloads.","kill_condition":"Stop if cache collisions suppress good drafts, repeated rejects are rare, or gains only appear on contrived traces.","mechanism":"Record rejected speculative continuations and penalize or avoid equivalent future draft proposals for similar context hashes while target verification remains authoritative.","success_threshold":"Repeated rejects fall at least 25% and TPOT improves at least 5% on looping agentic tasks without reducing accepted length elsewhere.","title":"Negative Rejection Cache for Agentic Speculation"},"content_sha256":"f6ad4029014fe070d01f2d8b031a04d7d8626e0ce1a25f1537a8f2cfb8ddd9bd","rank":10,"source_file":"new-chatgpt-pro-ideas-0